# Superseded — use rules/ and skills/

This monolithic file is **retired**. Cursor now loads:

| Layer | Path (this bundle) |
|-------|---------------------|
| Always-on rules | `Config/.cursor/rules/*.mdc` |
| File-scoped rules | same folder (`globs` in frontmatter) |
| Agent skills | `Config/.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` |

**Install:** copy or symlink `rules/` → `~/.cursor/rules/` and `skills/` →
`~/.cursor/skills/` (see `README.md`).

**Archive:** the previous DeCovarT monolith is
`archive/.cursorrules.decovart-monolith` — do not copy it to new projects.

For this Quarto book only, also enable `rules/teaching-material-repo.mdc`
(project `.cursor/rules/` or copy from here).
